{
  "uid": "v2-engine",
  "title": "v2 · Engine — oeecloud-worker (AMQP→jobs→writes)",
  "tags": ["packiot-v2", "engine", "flow"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": { "from": "now-6h", "to": "now" },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "tenant",
        "label": "Tenant",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "packiot-prometheus" },
        "query": { "query": "label_values(oeecloud_worker_batch_writes_total, tenant)", "refId": "A" },
        "refresh": 2,
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "current": { "text": "All", "value": "$__all" }
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "packiot-prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 3, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Is the OEE engine healthy end-to-end? — AMQP in → scheduled jobs → batch writes\noeecloud-worker consumes `sparkplug.data` envelopes off RabbitMQ, runs the rollup/UNS/report/bake **jobs**, and writes each tenant's rows. Use `$tenant` to slice. Job error/panic rate must stay flat 0; write-error rate must stay flat 0."
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "AMQP deliveries by result (per s)",
      "description": "sum by(result) rate(oeecloud_worker_amqp_deliveries_total[5m]). acked = handed to the engine · nacked_retry = transient failure, re-queued · exhausted_failed = dropped to oee-failed. A steady acked line with flat nacked/exhausted is healthy.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "packiot-prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 3 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "cps", "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 10, "showPoints": "never" } }, "overrides": [ { "matcher": { "id": "byRegexp", "options": ".*failed.*" }, "properties": [ { "id": "color", "value": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "red" } } ] } ] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "packiot-prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum by (result) (rate(oeecloud_worker_amqp_deliveries_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{result}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Handler latency p50 / p95",
      "description": "histogram_quantile over oeecloud_worker_handler_duration_seconds_bucket — how long each envelope takes to process end-to-end.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "packiot-prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 3 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "s", "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 8, "showPoints": "never" } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "packiot-prometheus" },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.5, sum by (le) (rate(oeecloud_worker_handler_duration_seconds_bucket[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p50",
          "refId": "A"
        },
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "packiot-prometheus" },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(oeecloud_worker_handler_duration_seconds_bucket[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "p95",
          "refId": "B"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Last outcome per job (everything should read ok)",
      "description": "oeecloud_worker_job_ticks_total, instant, grouped by job × outcome. Each scheduled job (rollups, UNS, reports, bake) should show its ticks under outcome=ok; any error/panic row names the failing job.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "packiot-prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 11 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": { "custom": { "align": "auto", "cellOptions": { "type": "auto" } }, "unit": "short" },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": { "showHeader": true, "cellHeight": "sm", "sortBy": [{ "displayName": "job", "desc": false }] },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "packiot-prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum by (job, outcome) (oeecloud_worker_job_ticks_total)",
          "format": "table",
          "instant": true,
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ],
      "transformations": [
        { "id": "filterFieldsByName", "options": { "include": { "names": ["job", "outcome", "Value"] } } },
        { "id": "organize", "options": { "renameByName": { "Value": "ticks" } } }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Job error / panic rate (healthy = flat 0)",
      "description": "sum by(outcome) rate(oeecloud_worker_job_ticks_total{outcome=~\"error|panic\"}[5m]). A flat zero line is correct — this is a truthful-empty when the engine is clean.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "packiot-prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 11 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "cps", "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 12, "showPoints": "auto" }, "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "red" } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["sum"] }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "packiot-prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum by (outcome) (rate(oeecloud_worker_job_ticks_total{outcome=~\"error|panic\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{outcome}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Batch write rate by tenant (rows/s)",
      "description": "sum by(tenant) rate(oeecloud_worker_batch_writes_total{result=\"ok\"}[5m]), sliced by $tenant.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "packiot-prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 9, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 20 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "wps", "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 8, "showPoints": "never" } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["mean", "lastNotNull"] }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "packiot-prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum by (tenant) (rate(oeecloud_worker_batch_writes_total{tenant=~\"$tenant\", result=\"ok\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{tenant}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "PO parameter writer ops by op",
      "description": "sum by(op) rate(oeecloud_worker_writer_po_parameter_ops_total[5m]). NOTE: skipped_30700 and skipped_30800_30899 are the config params (machine sequence / PO-control lifecycle) the edge-transformer handles elsewhere — a non-zero skip count is EXPECTED, not an error.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "packiot-prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 29 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "cps", "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 10, "showPoints": "auto" } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "packiot-prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum by (op) (rate(oeecloud_worker_writer_po_parameter_ops_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{op}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "PO control ops by op (30800s lifecycle)",
      "description": "sum by(op) rate(oeecloud_worker_po_control_ops_total[5m]) — start / stop / setup PO-control commands routed through the shadow paths.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "packiot-prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 29 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "cps", "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 10, "showPoints": "auto" } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "packiot-prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum by (op) (rate(oeecloud_worker_po_control_ops_total[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{op}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 9,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Unroutable topics by tenant (drops/s) — should be flat 0",
      "description": "sum by(tenant) rate(packml_unresolved_topic_total[5m]) — equipment_values metrics SKIPPED because their packml_topic has no active packml_register row. Any sustained non-zero = a tenant is publishing a topic with no active register row (missing onboarding/apply-register or active=false) → its equipment_values are silently empty. Backs the PackmlUnroutableTopic alert.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "packiot-prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 37 },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "cps", "custom": { "drawStyle": "line", "lineWidth": 2, "fillOpacity": 10, "showPoints": "auto" }, "thresholds": { "mode": "absolute", "steps": [{ "color": "green", "value": null }, { "color": "red", "value": 0.0001 }] } }, "overrides": [] },
      "options": { "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["mean", "lastNotNull"] }, "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" } },
      "targets": [
        {
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "packiot-prometheus" },
          "expr": "sum by (tenant) (rate(packml_unresolved_topic_total{tenant=~\"$tenant\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{tenant}}",
          "refId": "A"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
